Verse 1:
[D]Oh now I see the [G]crimson wave, The [D]fountain deep and [A]wide;
[D]Jesus, my Lord, might[G]y to save, Points [D]to His wound[A7]ed [D]side.
[D]The [G]cleansing stream I [D]see, I see, I [A]plunge, and [A7]O, it [G]cleanseth [D]me!
[D]O [G]praise the Lord! it [D]cleanseth me, It [A]cleanseth me, [A7]yes, cleanseth [D]me.

Refrain:
[D]The [G]cleansing stream [D]I see, [A]I see,
[D]I [G]plunge, [D]and O, [A7]it [D]cleanseth me!
[D]O [G]praise [D]the [A]Lord! [A7]it [G]cleanseth [D]me,
