Verse 2:
[D]I [G]see the [D]new [A]creation rise,
[D]I [G]hear [D]the [A7]speaking [D]blood;
[D][G]It [D]speaks [A][A7]polluted [G]nature [D]dies,
[D][G]Sinks [D]'neath [A]the [A7]cleansing [D]flood.

Verse 3:
[D]I rise [G]to walk [D]in heaven's [A]own light,
[D]Above [G]the [D]world [A7]and [D]sin;
[D]With [G]heart [D]made [A]pure [A7]and [G]garments [D]white,
[D][G]And [D]Christ [A][A7]enthroned [D]within.

Verse 4:
[D]Amazing [G]grace! [D]'tis [A]heaven below
[D]To [G]feel [D]the [A7]blood [D]applied,
[D][G]And [D]Jesus, [A][A7]only [G]Jesus, [D]know,
[D][G]My [D][A]Jesus [A7][D]crucified.
